Great conversation today at @housescience on the use of Am-241 nuclear batteries (like from @zeno_power) to enable the @NASAMoonBase - 
@SecretaryWright from @ENERGY: “Nuclear batteries before we go to reactors…Being a leader in space, being a leader in not just Earth orbit, but in far space, is not only great for American science, innovation, and American spirit, but it will matter for national defense as well. @NASA is, like our National Labs, a national treasure, and getting NASA as a partner now with private business to drive space forward I think will bring huge benefits not just to Forida but to our country.”
@RepHaridopolos: “Some of the new technologies you speak of right now will be things that power us on the Moon.”

